          {
            "t": "h",
            "text": "Aturan inti"
          },
          {
            "t": "p",
            "text": "Satu klausa butuh tepat satu subject dan satu verb sejati. Kurang, atau berlebih tanpa connector, berarti kalimatnya salah."
          },
          {
            "t": "h",
            "text": "Subject"
          },
          {
            "t": "p",
            "text": "Frasa depan (in the morning, with his secretary) dan keterangan waktu bukan subject. Lewati frasa depan, cari kata benda yang melakukan aksi."
          },
          {
            "t": "xray",
            "marked": "P{On her lunch hour} S{she} V{went} P{to a nearby department store}.",
            "caption": "Frasa depan dicoret, sisanya satu subject dan satu verb."
          },
          {
            "t": "h",
            "text": "Verb sejati vs penerang"
          },
          {
            "t": "p",
            "text": "Verb sejati membawa tense: bentuk lampau atau present, atau didampingi be, have, modal. Bentuk -ing tanpa be dan -ed tanpa be/have hanya penerang."
          },
          {
            "t": "xray",
            "marked": "S{The papers} M{being delivered at 4:00} V{will contain} the announcement P{of the resignation}.",
            "caption": "'being delivered' tidak membawa tense, jadi penerang. Verb sejatinya will contain."
          },
          {
            "t": "xray",
            "marked": "S{The fir trees} V{were grown} P{for the holiday season} V{were harvested} P{in November}.",
            "caption": "Dua verb sejati, satu subject, tanpa connector: salah. Jadikan 'grown' penerang."
          },
          {
            "t": "h",
            "text": "Cek cepat"
          },
          {
            "t": "list",
            "items": [
              "Coret frasa depan.",
              "Tandai penerang: -ing atau -ed tanpa be/have, appositive.",
              "Cari subject dan verb sejati.",
              "Hitung: satu pasang per klausa?"
            ]
          }
